<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Synthetic Data Generation</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
        .form-group { margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            margin-top: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
            text-align: center;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .logo { font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .red-header { background-color: #cc0000; color: white; padding: 15px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .red-header h2 { color: white; margin: 0; }
        .input-field { width: 100%; padding: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid #ccc; }
        .text-center { text-align: center; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
    <h1 style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">Authorized Payer Forgot Login Name or Forgot Password</h1>
    <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">For Forgot Login Name – Click on Forgot Login Name</p>

    <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <div class="logo" style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">SMU.pay</div>
        <div class="red-header">
            <h2 style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">Bursar Authorized Payer Login</h2>
            <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">Please enter your Login Name and Password in the fields below and then click the "Login" button.</p>
        </div>
        <form style="max-width: 400px; margin: 0 auto;">
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="login_name" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Login Name:</label>
                <input type="text" id="login_name" class="input-field" value="{{ login_name }}">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="password" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Password:</label>
                <input type="password" id="password" class="input-field">
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
                <button type="button" class="button" style="background-color: #007bff; color: white; border: none;">Forgot Login Name</button>
                <button type="button" class="button" style="background-color: #ffc107; color: black; border: none;">Forgot Password</button>
                <button type="submit" class="button" style="background-color: #28a745; color: white; border: none;">Log in</button>
            </div>
        </form>
        <p style="font-size: 12px; text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">User information is protected. Unauthorized access is prohibited.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">Enter Authorized Payer email address</h2>

    <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <div class="logo" style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">SMU.pay</div>
        <div style="max-width: 400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">
            <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif; text-align: center;">Forgot Login Name?</p>
            <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;">To retrieve your login name, you can enter the primary email address or secondary email address you selected when you signed up. If you do not have access to your primary email address or secondary email address, contact a customer service representative for assistance.</p>
            <form style="margin-top: 20px;">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="email" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">E-mail:</label>
                    <input type="email" id="email" class="input-field" value="{{ email_address }}">
                </div>
                <div class="text-center">
                    <button type="submit" class="button" style="background-color: #007bff; color: white; border: none;">Retrieve Login Name</button>
                    <button type="button" class="button" style="background-color: #6c757d; color: white; border: none;">Cancel</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">Click Retrieve Login Name</h2>

    <div style="margin-top: 30px; text-align: center;">
        <div class="logo" style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">SMU.pay</div>
        <div style="padding: 40px; border: 1px solid #ddd; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
            <h3 style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">Login Name Lookup Successful</h3>
            <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">&#10003; You entered a valid email address that is in our system, you will be receiving an email message containing the login name and instructions for logging in.</p>
            <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif; margin-top: 20px;">Click here to return to the Login Page</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 50px; text-align: center;">
        <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">The following email notification will be sent to the Authorized Payer's email address</p>
    </div>

    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #eee; font-family: 'DejaVu Serif', 'Liberation Serif', Georgia, serif;">
        <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">Your Login Name is <span data-field="retrieved_login_name">{{ retrieved_login_name }}</span></p>
        <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">You can access the system at</p>
        <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">Regards,</p>
        <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">QuikPAY Online Services</p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 50px; text-align: center;">
        <h3 style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">For Forgot Password – Click Forgot Password</h3>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">For Forgot Password – Click Forgot Password</h2>

    <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <div class="logo" style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">SMU.pay</div>
        <div class="red-header">
            <h2 style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">Bursar Authorized Payer Login</h2>
            <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">Please enter your Login Name and Password in the fields below and then click the "Login" button.</p>
        </div>
        <form style="max-width: 400px; margin: 0 auto;">
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="login_name_pwd" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Login Name:</label>
                <input type="text" id="login_name_pwd" class="input-field" value="{{ login_name_pwd }}">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="password_pwd" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Password:</label>
                <input type="password" id="password_pwd" class="input-field">
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
                <button type="button" class="button" style="background-color: #007bff; color: white; border: none;">Forgot Login Name</button>
                <button type="button" class="button" style="background-color: #ffc107; color: black; border: none;">Forgot Password</button>
                <button type="submit" class="button" style="background-color: #28a745; color: white; border: none;">Log in</button>
            </div>
        </form>
        <p style="font-size: 12px; text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">User information is protected. Unauthorized access is prohibited.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">Enter Login Name</h2>

    <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <div class="logo" style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">SMU.pay</div>
        <div style="max-width: 400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">
            <h3 style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">Password Reset Email Request</h3>
            <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">To change your password, please enter your username and an email will be sent to you with a secure link to reset your password.</p>
            <form style="margin-top: 20px;">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="login_name_reset" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Login Name:</label>
                    <input type="text" id="login_name_reset" class="input-field" value="{{ login_name_reset }}">
                </div>
                <div class="text-center">
                    <button type="submit" class="button" style="background-color: #007bff; color: white; border: none;">Reset Password</button>
                    <button type="button" class="button" style="background-color: #6c757d; color: white; border: none;">Cancel</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 50px; text-align: center;">
        <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">Click Reset Password</p>
        <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">The following email notification will be sent to the Authorized Payer's email address</p>
    </div>

    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #eee; font-family: 'DejaVu Serif', 'Liberation Serif', Georgia, serif;">
        <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">Please use this link to complete the password reset process:</p>
        <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">Upon accessing the system, you will be required to reset your password.</p>
        <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">After resetting your password, you can login in the future at <a href="{{ system_url }}">{{ system_url }}</a></p>
        <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">Regards,</p>
        <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">QuikPAY College</p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 50px; text-align: center;">
        <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">Click on the link</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">Set Password</h2>

    <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <div class="logo" style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">SMU.pay</div>
        <div style="max-width: 400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">
            <h3 style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif;">Set Password</h3>
            <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">For security reasons, you must change your password.</p>
            <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">Passwords cannot be both strong and easy to remember. For example, "My Aunt Mae was born in 1932" is a strong password, but it is also easy to remember. We suggest you create a complex password that is at least eight characters long and must include at least one letter, one number, and one special character.</p>
            <form style="margin-top: 20px;">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="new_password" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">New Password:</label>
                    <input type="password" id="new_password" class="input-field">
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="confirm_password" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Confirm Password:</label>
                    <input type="password" id="confirm_password" class="input-field">
                </div>
                <div class="text-center">
                    <button type="submit" class="button" style="background-color: #28a745; color: white; border: none;">Continue</button>
                </div>
            </form>
            <p style="font-size: 12px; text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">NOTE: Password must be at least eight characters long and must include at least two (2) letters and two (2) numbers.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>